<title>USA: GTI Corp to sell Network Access Card.</title>
<headline>GTI Corp to sell Network Access Card.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTI Corp said its Promptus subsidiary has agreed to sell the assets and associated liabilities of its Network Access Card business to VideoServer Inc for about $20 million.</p>
<p>The sale is subject to regulatory approval.</p>
<p>The company said that Promptus has agreed, upon closing the sale, to repay loans from GTI and to redeem all the common stock held by GTI. It said repayment of loans from GTI will be made with about 158,000 shares of the VideoServer common stock plus about $8.2 million in cash.</p>
</text>
